      "value": "This seems to be the same issue as the one recently marked as available in a future release here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/cache-directory-does-not-store-texturecache-to-the-configured-directory\n\nThe user I replied to in that report clarified that they were formatting their cache path incorrectly, so there was no bug there.\n\nI'm going to close this report for now as a duplicate, but please feel free to retest this in the next open beta release for 2026.4.1 if you'd like to make sure it's fixed and let us know here if it isn't. Thanks!",
